<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the STI index.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the STI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued 14 million European-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on the Straits Times industrial index, lead manager Deutsche Bak AG said.</p>
<p> COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	05.JUN.01   PAYDATE	30.AUG.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> VALUE OF INDEX  2276.56     100 WARRANTS RELARE TO ONE INDEX</p>
<p>		STRIKE	  ISSUE	  PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL A     2618.04 DEM   4.36 DEM     34.15 PCT</p>
<p> CALL B     3301.01 DEM   2.37 DEM     55.41 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
